### Quick Reference

| Endpoint | Method | Description |
|----------|--------|-------------|
| `/health` | GET | Health check |
| `/api/v1/resources` | GET | List resources |
| `/api/v1/resources` | POST | Create resource |
| `/api/v1/resources/{id}` | GET | Get resource |
| `/api/v1/resources/{id}` | PUT | Update resource |
| `/api/v1/resources/{id}` | DELETE | Delete resource |

## Configuration

Configuration is loaded from:
1. `configs/config.yaml` - Base configuration
2. `configs/config.{env}.yaml` - Environment-specific overrides
3. Environment variables - Highest priority

## Deployment

### Docker

```bash
docker build -t {{ .vars.service_name | lower }} .
docker run -p 8080:8080 {{ .vars.service_name | lower }}
```

### Kubernetes

```bash
kubectl apply -f deployments/kubernetes/
```

### Helm

```bash
helm install {{ .vars.service_name | lower }} deployments/helm/
```

